// ============================================================
// ============================================================
// Purpose:
//   Provides a reproducible development environment using VS Code
//   Dev Containers.
//
//   On container creation:
//     1. A minimal Ubuntu 22.04 image is pulled.
//     2. Go 1.22, GitHub CLI, and common-utils are installed
//        (as devcontainer features).
//     3. .devcontainer/setup.sh runs as postCreateCommand to
//        install the full toolchain (shellcheck, shfmt,
//        golangci-lint, markdownlint, yamllint, actionlint,
//        pre-commit, etc.).
//     4. VS Code extensions are installed automatically.
//
// Usage:
//   code .
//   F1 → "Dev Containers: Reopen in Container"
//   Wait ~2-4 minutes (first run only).
//
// Reference:
//   https://containers.dev/implementors/json_reference/
//
// ============================================================
// Features used:
// ============================================================
//   ┌───────────────────────────────┬────────┬──────────┐
//   │ Feature                             │ Version │ Purpose    │
//   ├───────────────────────────────┼────────┼──────────┤
//   │ devcontainers/features/go           │ 1       │ Go 1.22    │
//   │ devcontainers/features/github-cli   │ 1       │ gh CLI     │
//   │ devcontainers/features/common-utils │ 2       │ base utils │
//   └───────────────────────────────┴────────┴──────────┘
//
//   The `:1` / `:2` suffix in each feature key is the feature's
//   MAJOR version (devcontainer spec). Dependabot tracks these
//   under the "devcontainers" ecosystem — see
//   .github/dependabot.yml §[3].
//
// ============================================================
// postCreateCommand chain:
// ============================================================
//   1. The image + features install their base tooling.
//   2. .devcontainer/setup.sh runs (bash, idempotent, verbose).
//   3. setup.sh installs the remaining dev tools:
//        • shellcheck        (shell linting)
//        • shfmt             (shell formatting)
//        • golangci-lint v2  (Go linting)
//        • staticcheck       (Go static analysis)
//        • gosec             (Go security, optional)
//        • actionlint        (GH Actions linting)
//        • markdownlint-cli  (if npm is available)
//        • yamllint          (Python)
//        • detect-secrets    (Python)
//        • pre-commit        (Python)
//   4. setup.sh runs a final verification and prints a table of
//      installed tool versions.
//
//   If postCreateCommand fails, re-run it manually:
//     bash .devcontainer/setup.sh
//
// ============================================================
// remoteUser:
// ============================================================
//   The container runs as `vscode` (non-root). This matters for
//   tools that install into $HOME (go binaries, pip user packages,
//   pre-commit hooks). Any tool that needs root uses sudo, which
//   is pre-configured for the vscode user in devcontainer base
//   images.
//
// ============================================================
// v1.1.0 additions (kept in v1.2.0):
// ============================================================
//   • Version bumped to v1.1.0 (documentation only — no behavior
//     changes since v1.0.0).
//   • Added a "Features used" table for quick scanning.
//   • Expanded the "postCreateCommand chain" section to list all
//     tools installed by setup.sh (previously only mentioned by
//     name).
//   • Added a note about remoteUser behavior — this affects where
//     Go binaries and Python packages land, which is a common
//     source of confusion when debugging "command not found"
//     errors.
//
// ============================================================
// v1.2.0 additions:
// ============================================================
//   • Version bumped to v1.2.0 (documentation only — no behavior
//     changes since v1.1.0).
//   • The v1.2.0 release is a data-preservation release. It does
//     NOT add any new dependencies, new tools, or new build steps.
//     Therefore this devcontainer configuration requires NO
//     changes to remain compatible with v1.2.0.
//   • Confirmed: the 10 defensive layers introduced by v1.2.0
//     live in shell scripts (customize.sh, service.sh, status.sh,
//     uninstall.sh, functions.sh, watchdog.sh) and in main.go.
//     None of them require a new tool for development or testing.
//   • The dev environment used to develop v1.1.0 is the same
//     environment used to develop v1.2.0. No tool was added,
//     removed, or upgraded.
//   • Cross-referenced docs/BACKUP.md and docs/EMERGENCY.md for
//     readers who land here from a data-preservation context:
//     those documents describe RUNTIME behavior on a real Android
//     device, not development tooling. Testing the 10 layers
//     requires a rooted Android device (or the emulator matrix
//     in .github/workflows/upgrade-test.yml), not a new dev tool.
//   • Expanded the "Features used" table with clear column
//     headers for readability.
//   • All comments are English-only (global edition). No Arabic
//     strings exist in this file.
// ============================================================
{
  "name": "DNSCrypt Smart Filter Dev",

  "author": "gasciljh",

  "repository": "https://github.com/gasciljh/dnscrypt-proxy-webui",

  "image": "mcr.microsoft.com/devcontainers/base:ubuntu-22.04",

  "features": {
    "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/go:1": {
      "version": "1.22"
    },
    "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/github-cli:1": {},
    "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/common-utils:2": {
      "installZsh": false,
      "installOhMyZsh": false,
      "upgradePackages": true
    }
  },

  "postCreateCommand": "bash .devcontainer/setup.sh",

  "customizations": {
    "vscode": {
      "extensions": [
        "golang.go",
        "timonwong.shellcheck",
        "foxundermoon.shell-format",
        "yzhang.markdown-all-in-one",
        "redhat.vscode-yaml",
        "streetsidesoftware.code-spell-checker",
        "editorconfig.editorconfig"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "go.useLanguageServer": true,
        "go.lintTool": "golangci-lint",
        "go.lintFlags": ["--fast"],
        "go.testFlags": ["-race", "-count=1"],
        "editor.formatOnSave": true,
        "editor.insertSpaces": true,
        "editor.tabSize": 4,
        "files.eol": "\n",
        "files.trimTrailingWhitespace": true,
        "files.insertFinalNewline": true,
        "[go]": {
          "editor.defaultFormatter": "golang.go",
          "editor.insertSpaces": false
        },
        "[shellscript]": {
          "editor.defaultFormatter": "foxundermoon.shell-format",
          "editor.tabSize": 4
        },
        "[yaml]": {
          "editor.tabSize": 2
        },
        "[json]": {
          "editor.tabSize": 2
        },
        "[jsonc]": {
          "editor.tabSize": 2
        },
        "[markdown]": {
          "editor.tabSize": 2,
          "editor.wordWrap": "on"
        },
        "shellcheck.enable": true,
        "shellcheck.run": "onType",
        "shellcheck.severity": "warning"
      }
    }
  },

  "remoteUser": "vscode",

  "containerEnv": {
    "PROJECT_URL": "https://github.com/gasciljh/dnscrypt-proxy-webui",
    "GOFLAGS": "-buildvcs=false -trimpath"
  }
}